# Everything here stays out of the edge asset bundle.
#
# The asset directory is the repo root so that GitHub Pages keeps serving the
# site unchanged until the DNS cutover. That means wrangler also watches its
# own local state during `wrangler dev`, so .wrangler must be excluded or the
# dev server reloads in a loop as D1 writes to disk.
.wrangler/
worker/
node_modules/
schema.sql
wrangler.jsonc
package.json
package-lock.json
README.md
CLAUDE.md
.github/
.git/
.claude/
.assetsignore

# Full-size photo originals are kept in git for safekeeping, not served.
img/archive/

# Source newsletters are uploaded to R2 by the admin, never served as files.
*.pdf
